00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.510
Although, I would be very
impressed if you could do so.

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:54.350
So Visual Studio Extensions.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:54.891
That's great.

00:11:54.891 --> 00:11:57.890
But having an IDE
clicking around,

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:00.230
it's not for everyone,
