00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:18.650
But for things a
little more advanced,

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:22.250
like automating common
tasks, or scripting things,

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.530
maybe you don't want to
break down and write a custom

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:28.730
application but just maybe a
100-line PowerShell script.

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:31.730
So John's going to show
us the commands that

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.840
are available in the Google
Cloud PowerShell module.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:39.470
And this is installed with the
Cloud SDK on Windows machines.

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:41.715
So you likely already
have this available.

00:12:41.715 --> 00:12:44.090
JOHN SKEET: We will not be
going through every single one

00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:44.630
