00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.700
Those that are in
the generated folder,

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.800
get their name, metadata size.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:12.570
And then filter them such that
the metadata's language value

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:13.230
is equal to F#.

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:21.990
And then output
it to a grid view.

